# Agent tooling artifacts. AGENTS.md is regenerated with a fresh timestamp on
# every session by the claude-mem plugin (<claude-mem-context> wrapper), so an
# untracked copy otherwise leaves the tree permanently dirty and can be swept
# into a commit by an auto-committing session.
/AGENTS.md

